			},
			text = [=[In {link:tanaris}Tanaris{/link}, the troll {link:yeh-kinya}Yeh'kinya{/link} spoke of the old prophecy of the trolls, that the dead god would one day return to the earth. He did not believe the myth. He did believe that the essence of Hakkar held great power, and that it must be kept from those who would abuse it. From the tablets of the prophet Mosh'aru, taken long ago to {red:zul-farrak}Zul'Farrak{/red}, he learned how an ancient egg might hold that essence.]=],
