			text = [=[The Egg of Hakkar was carried into the drowned temple, and there its power stirred the god. His avatar came forth into the world and was destroyed, and his essence was sealed in the egg. When it was brought back to {link:tanaris}Tanaris{/link}, it stirred with life. {link:yeh-kinya}Yeh'kinya{/link} was troubled. He had not believed the myths, and now he feared what Hakkar might do if he were born again. He swore to keep the egg safe.]=],
